    "body": "Thanks for working on this!\r\n\r\n> https://wpt.live/screen-orientation/page-visibility-manual.html \r\n\r\nAlthough I can't really follow the test too well, I'm wondering if it tests the main interactions, which are:\r\n\r\n- `document.visibilityState` will return \"visible\" inside the `change` event handler for screen orientation\r\n- `visibilitychange` for the document will fire after `change` for the screen orientation\r\n\r\n?\r\n\r\nThis is not required for merging, since technically the only normative change being introduced here is clarifying the relationship to device posture and Web NFC (screen orientation goes first, after this change). Eventually we'll want to test all three of device posture, screen orientation, and Web NFC, but we can leave that for the future...",
